{"seq":1,"slug":"violation-taxonomy-policy-engine","title":"违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/violation-taxonomy-policy-engine","wordCount":2760,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模\">违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模</h1><p>一个卖家在凌晨 3 点被限制销售，真正执行这个动作的只是一条 <code>block_listing</code> 指令。要让这条指令可解释、可申诉、可审计，平台必须先把它归到一条明确的违规条款上，再用一份确定性或可解释概率的规则说清「为什么是这条、为什么是现在」。这就是本文要拆开的两层：<strong>违规分类法（taxonomy）定义「有哪些规则」，政策规则引擎（policy rule engine）定义「规则怎么被判定出来、判定后怎么被处置」</strong>。二者合起来才是账户健康的判定底座——绩效指标是它的输出信号，申诉与恢复工单是它的下游消费者，而分类法一旦建模错误，后面每一环都在放大误差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-政策即代码与判定-处置分离\">核心概念：政策即代码与判定/处置分离</h2><p>平台合规工程沿用了「policy as code」的传统，把违规处理拆为四层：<strong>分类 taxonomy → 规则 rule → 判定 decision → 处置 enforcement</strong>。前两层是政策文本的机器可读化，后两层是引擎运行时的关注点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[政策文本 / DSA / 平台细则] --&gt; B[违规分类法&lt;br/&gt;taxonomy: 条款ID + 三轴标签]&#10;  B --&gt; C[规则表达层&lt;br/&gt;DSL / 决策表 / 版本化]&#10;  C --&gt; D[信号采集&lt;br/&gt;listing抓取 / 订单 / 买家举报 / 模型打分]&#10;  D --&gt; E[规则求值&lt;br/&gt;确定性 + 概率分类器]&#10;  E --&gt; F{置信度 &gt;= 条款阈值?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[仅监控 / 抽样人工复核]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[处置决策&lt;br/&gt;enforcement ladder]&#10;  H --&gt; I[通知卖家 + 证据包 + 理由说明]&#10;  I --&gt; J[申诉 / 人工或模型二审]&#10;  J --&gt;|推翻| K[回滚 + 负样本回流规则]&#10;  J --&gt;|维持| L[升级处置 / 资金预留]&#10;  K --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[政策文本 / DSA / 平台细则] --&gt; B[违规分类法&lt;br/&gt;taxonomy: 条款ID + 三轴标签]\n  B --&gt; C[规则表达层&lt;br/&gt;DSL / 决策表 / 版本化]\n  C --&gt; D[信号采集&lt;br/&gt;listing抓取 / 订单 / 买家举报 / 模型打分]\n  D --&gt; E[规则求值&lt;br/&gt;确定性 + 概率分类器]\n  E --&gt; F{置信度 &gt;= 条款阈值?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[仅监控 / 抽样人工复核]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[处置决策&lt;br/&gt;enforcement ladder]\n  H --&gt; I[通知卖家 + 证据包 + 理由说明]\n  I --&gt; J[申诉 / 人工或模型二审]\n  J --&gt;|推翻| K[回滚 + 负样本回流规则]\n  J --&gt;|维持| L[升级处置 / 资金预留]\n  K --&gt; C</pre><p>这张图最重要的性质是 <strong>判定与处置必须是两个独立模块</strong>。判定回答「这条违规成立吗、置信度多少」；处置回答「成立之后，按卖家历史与严重度该做什么动作」。把二者耦合进一条 if-else 链的引擎无法支撑两类最常见的运维需求：同一违规对不同卖家给不同处置；以及同一处置（如资金预留）由多条违规条款共同触发。成熟平台因此普遍暴露两个接口——<code>evaluate(subject) -&gt; violation[]</code> 与 <code>decide(violation[], seller_history) -&gt; action</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>硬编码 if-else</th>\n<th>政策规则引擎（policy-as-code）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更成本</td>\n<td>改代码 + 全量发版</td>\n<td>改规则对象 + 灰度生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>日志里只有堆栈</td>\n<td>命中条款 ID + 证据 + 规则版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申诉支撑</td>\n<td>无法复述判定链</td>\n<td>可导出判定快照供复议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境差异</td>\n<td>一个市场一个分支</td>\n<td>同一条款按 region 挂不同规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"违规分类法的三轴建模\">违规分类法的三轴建模</h2><p>分类法不是一张扁平的违规类型清单——扁平清单在多平台、多法域下会迅速爆炸，因为同一「虚假宣传」在美区、欧盟 DSA 语境、印尼本地法规下的构成要件并不相同。工程上把它建成<strong>三轴笛卡尔空间</strong>：轴线 A 是<strong>客体（what）</strong>，轴线 B 是<strong>性质（why）</strong>，轴线 C 是<strong>法域（where）</strong>。任一条违规就是 A × B × C 上的一个点，条款 ID 由此保持稳定。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>轴线 A 客体</strong>：listing 内容（标题、主图、A+、关键词）、交易履约（发货时效、取消率、追踪有效性）、账户主体（身份真实性、多账户关联）、售后与资金（退款拒付、资金链）、受限商品（认证缺失、危险品）。</li>\n<li><strong>轴线 B 性质</strong>：合规性（法律硬约束，如 EU GPSR 要求的欧盟责任人）、平台政策（平台自定的标题字符规则）、诚信与欺诈（刷单、好评返现、伪造追踪）。</li>\n<li><strong>轴线 C 法域</strong>：US / EU / UK / JP / SEA / 拉美等，同一性质在不同法域挂不同条规。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原子条款表示例（ID 采用 <code>&lt;域&gt;.&lt;客体&gt;.&lt;性质&gt;.&lt;法域&gt;</code> 分层命名）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条款 ID</th>\n<th>客体</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>硬触发信号</th>\n<th>默认严重度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu</code></td>\n<td>listing 内容 / 受限商品</td>\n<td>合规性</td>\n<td>缺欧盟责任人 或 CE/DoC</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ctg.listing.restricted.paraphernalia.us</code></td>\n<td>受限商品</td>\n<td>合规性</td>\n<td>类目词表 + 模型置信</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int.order.tracking_invalid.all</code></td>\n<td>交易履约</td>\n<td>诚信</td>\n<td>追踪号承运商校验失败率 &gt; 阈值</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int.seller.review_manipulation.all</code></td>\n<td>账户主体</td>\n<td>诚信</td>\n<td>评论-订单图谱异常 + 增速突变</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pol.listing.title_rule.all</code></td>\n<td>listing 内容</td>\n<td>平台政策</td>\n<td>标题超长 / 全大写 / 关键词堆砌</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择分层 ID 而非自增数字的理由是：<strong>ID 是跨系统契约</strong>。卖家通知模板、资金预留原因码、申诉表单的条款下拉、合规报表都要引用它；分层 ID 自带语义，条款合并或拆分时可用前缀做批量映射，而自增 ID 在重构时直接丢失溯源链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则表达-从决策表到规则-dsl\">规则表达：从决策表到规则 DSL</h2><p>分类法定「有哪些条款」，规则引擎定「怎么判」。工程上三种表达形态按复杂度递进，成熟系统通常同时持有：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>阈值与决策表</strong>：结构化「条件 → 动作」的二维表，适合确定性信号（如「追踪号格式非法」）。可由运营在后台维护，变更不要求代码发版。</li>\n<li><strong>规则 DSL</strong>：表达决策表覆盖不了的组合逻辑，如「标题长度 &gt; 200 且含 ≥3 个品牌词且非授权品牌 → 命中堆砌」。DSL 必须带版本号与 AST，求值时产出<strong>命中路径</strong>（命中了哪几条子条件），供申诉复议引用。</li>\n<li><strong>概率分类器</strong>：图像、文本、图谱模型输出违规概率，作为规则的一个<strong>信号源</strong>而非最终裁决。模型分数进入规则时必须附带可解释的辅助特征（触发词列表、相似图片对应的已知侵权样本），否则申诉环节拿不出证据给卖家看。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一条规则对象的最小 schema（声明式表达，非可执行代码）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"rule_id: ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu.v3&#10;term: ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu&#10;region: EU&#10;signals:&#10;  - type: attribute_missing&#10;    field: responsible_person&#10;  - type: doc_missing&#10;    field: declaration_of_conformity&#10;predicate: missing(responsible_person) or missing(declaration_of_conformity)&#10;severity_default: high&#10;effective_from: 2025-12-13&#10;evidence_template: [listing_snapshot, attribute_diff]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu.v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">term</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">signals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">attribute_missing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">responsible_person</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">doc_missing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">declaration_of_conformity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">predicate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">missing(responsible_person) or missing(declaration_of_conformity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">severity_default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2025-12-13</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">evidence_template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">listing_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">attribute_diff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计是规则对象里只有<strong>信号 + 谓词 + 证据模板</strong>，没有动作（action）。动作属于处置层，因此一条规则变更不会意外改变处置阶梯，反之处置策略调整也不必触碰分类法。规则还必须携带 <code>effective_from</code> / <code>effective_to</code>，因为监管条款有生效日，求值时要用<strong>下单或上架时点</strong>的规则版本，而不是当前版本——用今天的规则去回溯昨天上架的商品，是申诉被推翻的常见原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定置信度-分级处置与升级阶梯\">判定置信度、分级处置与升级阶梯</h2><p>违规判定天然带噪声：把合规商品误杀（假阳性，成本 = 卖家损失 + 申诉工单）与漏放违规（假阴性，成本 = 买家损害 + 监管风险）不可兼得。设阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 把模型分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 二值化，两类错误的期望成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[C] = c_{FP}\\cdot \\mathrm{FP}(\\tau) + c_{FN}\\cdot \\mathrm{FN}(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FN</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在受限商品与产品安全类目上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（监管罚款 + 召回成本），因此这类条款的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 应取低，宁可误杀；而低严重度的平台政策条款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 取高，减少对卖家的打扰。<strong>阈值必须逐条款标定，不是一个全局常数</strong>——这正是规则引擎要支持 per-rule 阈值的根本原因。</p>\n<p>处置层用**升级阶梯（enforcement ladder）**把「违规成立」翻译成「做什么」，核心变量是重复次数与时间窗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶梯</th>\n<th>触发条件（示例）</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 通知</td>\n<td>首次且低严重度</td>\n<td>后台警示，listing 保留</td>\n<td>仅需整改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 下架</td>\n<td>中严重度，或 L1 未整改</td>\n<td>单条 listing 抑制</td>\n<td>整改后自动恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 账户限制</td>\n<td>高严重度，或窗口内复犯</td>\n<td>暂停销售权限、触发资金预留</td>\n<td>申诉通过可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 终止</td>\n<td>严重欺诈或法律要求</td>\n<td>账户关闭、资金扣押</td>\n<td>不可逆或极难逆转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>升级窗口的数学本质是<strong>带遗忘的计数器</strong>：设某条款在时间窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 内第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次命中于时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、衰减率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，则加权违规分</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_{i} w_i\\, e^{-\\lambda (t - t_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 越过条款阈值即升一级。用指数衰减加权替代朴素的「窗口内固定次数」，可以区分「三次集中在一周内」与「三次分散在一年里」——前者是惯犯信号，后者多半是流程缺陷。多平台把这一机制产品化：Amazon 的账户状况评级把多类政策违规折算为 0–1000 分并划分 Good / At Risk / Unhealthy 区间（Amazon Seller Central 账户状况文档，<code>sellercentral.amazon.com</code>）；TikTok Shop 用店铺违规积分累进到阈值触发限权或清退。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多平台政策对齐与监管硬约束\">多平台政策对齐与监管硬约束</h2><p>跨境卖家同时经营多个平台，同一类违规在各平台的条款名、阈值、处置各不相同。规则引擎因此需要一层<strong>跨平台归一化映射（canonical term mapping）</strong>，把平台专有条款映射到本文定义的分类法原子条款，才能做统一的健康视图与合规报表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台 / 框架</th>\n<th>绩效中枢</th>\n<th>违规处置特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>账户状况评级（0–1000）+ 政策徽章</td>\n<td>分数区间决定升降级；绩效通知 + 申诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay</td>\n<td>Seller Standards 不良交易率</td>\n<td>月度评估，超标降为 Below Standard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok Shop</td>\n<td>店铺违规积分 + 体验分</td>\n<td>积分累进触发限权 / 清退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU DSA（EU 2022/2065）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Art. 20 内控申诉系统、Art. 21 庭外争议解决、Art. 23 措施透明度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU P2B（EU 2019/1150）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>限制前通知、说明理由、提供申诉渠道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这层映射的工程价值有两处：一是<strong>合规报表</strong>可按监管实体聚合（DSA 透明度报告、home member state 口径）；二是当某平台临时调整政策时，运营可以在映射层评估影响面——哪些卖家、哪些类目、多少 listing——而无需阅读引擎代码。</p>\n<p>监管条款还给处置规定了<strong>程序要件</strong>，必须内建进引擎而非事后补：DSA Art. 20 要求受限卖家有内部投诉处理系统，决定须附<strong>理由说明（statement of reasons）</strong>；Art. 21 要求提供经认证的庭外争议解决路径；P2B 2019/1150 要求在限制前通知并给出理由。落到工程上，这意味着每次处置都要生成一份结构化理由说明（条款 ID、事实、证据、申诉入口、时限），且<strong>不可回填</strong>——它是审计证据，后补的说明在法律上不成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>账户健康的判定底座 = <strong>违规分类法（有哪些条款）+ 政策规则引擎（怎么判、怎么处置）</strong>，二者必须解耦。</li>\n<li>分类法建为 <strong>客体 × 性质 × 法域</strong> 三轴空间，条款 ID 用分层命名充当跨系统契约，而非自增数字。</li>\n<li>规则表达按复杂度分三层：<strong>决策表 → 规则 DSL（带 AST 与命中路径）→ 概率分类器（作为信号而非裁决）</strong>；规则必须版本化，并按下单或上架时点求值。</li>\n<li>判定阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 应<strong>逐条款标定</strong>，因为假阴性与假阳性的成本在不同类目差异巨大；处置采用<strong>指数衰减加权的升级阶梯</strong>，而非窗口内固定次数。</li>\n<li>跨境场景需要<strong>跨平台归一化映射</strong>，并把 DSA Art. 20/21、P2B 的程序要件（理由说明、申诉时限）内建进引擎。</li>\n<li>本文描述的判定与处置输出即绩效指标的信号源；处置后的申诉与恢复流程见本章后续文档（章节索引：<a href=\"./\">违规监测与下架预警</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模","id":"违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：政策即代码与判定/处置分离","id":"核心概念-政策即代码与判定-处置分离"},{"level":2,"text":"违规分类法的三轴建模","id":"违规分类法的三轴建模"},{"level":2,"text":"规则表达：从决策表到规则 DSL","id":"规则表达-从决策表到规则-dsl"},{"level":2,"text":"判定置信度、分级处置与升级阶梯","id":"判定置信度-分级处置与升级阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"多平台政策对齐与监管硬约束","id":"多平台政策对齐与监管硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指标归因数据管道与口径漂移处置（Metric Attribution Pipeline & Definition Drift）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/metric-attribution-data-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"下架、listing 冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/takedown-suspension-enforcement"}}